  "description": "The E-Horizon Tour is a fully equipped e-trekking bike with perfectly integrated components. It includes features such as LED lights with a rear brake light function that increase rider safety in urban environments. The rear carrier is approved for 27 kg and child transportation in combination with a Thule Yepp 2 Maxi seat. The stepless internal gear hub provides reliable automatic shifting and is low maintenance. The hydraulic disc brakes offer superior braking power and modulation even in adverse weather conditions. For safer stopping this model comes equipped with an anti lock braking system.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line CX electric drive system offers powerful and long-lasting support, giving you the freedom to explore beyond your usual routes.\n\nThe high-capacity Bosch PowerTube battery integrated into the frame can be removed for remote charging, while the battery cover remains on the bike to protect the empty battery bay from the elements. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: Use the eBike Flow App to control your bike or add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range.",
